                                        "entry_id": "7ac5f531-b0b3-3312-8433-e424353bf766",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A thin blin (pancake), filled (often with sweet cheese) and folded, then fried and often served with sour cream, fruit, or a sweet sauce."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8c25e1fc-f624-4314-a63e-539d097d04bc",
                                                "sense_id": "737c87ac-4b5a-3215-b80a-7e00ffb93ca3",
                                                "text": "He carries his tray of blintzes filled with cottage cheese to the coffee urns and drains off a mug’s worth."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "85bff785-6f4f-4dd5-b7fe-e8ff72b3c90c",
